  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We create more than a hundred new videos every year. They are the culmination of countless hours of researching, writing, editing, animating, and producing. We comb through thousands of scientific papers from the peer-reviewed medical literature so busy people like you don’t have to!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In 2024, I covered a wide variety of hot topics. I released an update on </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/why-i-changed-my-mind-on-water-fluoridation/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">why I changed my mind on water fluoridation</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, a series on the benefits and side effects of </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/vaccines/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">flu, pneumonia, and shingles vaccines</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and, of course, a lot on aging and anti-aging based on my research for </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-age/\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Not to Age</span></i></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Which videos floated to the top last year? </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>#10 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Benefits and Side Effects of the Flu Vaccine</span></a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-103321 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Woman sneezing into a tissue\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/65-7-benefits-and-side-effects-of-the-flu-vaccine.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Randomized placebo-controlled trials show that flu shots can be extraordinary lifesavers. Can you prevent the flu with foods and supplements, like elderberry and echinacea? See </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/elderberry-benefits-and-side-effects-does-it-help-with-colds-and-the-flu/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Elderberry Benefits and Side Effects: Does It Help with Colds and the Flu?</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>#9 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Pros and Cons of Testing PSA Levels for Prostate Cancer</span></a></h4>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-102977 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Doctor and patient reviewing prostate test lab results\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/02/64-26-the-pros-and-cons-of-testing-psa-levels-for-prostate-cancer.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Given the clear harms and the small and uncertain benefits of PSA testing, most men would presumably decide to decline to undergo it if they knew all the facts, but that’s up to each individual to decide.</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you do get diagnosed with prostate cancer, what can you do with your diet, in addition to any other therapies you might choose? See the </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/prostate-cancer/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Prostate Cancer topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for all related videos.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>#8 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-fish-or-fish-oil-supplements-good-for-the-heart/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Are Fish or Fish Oil Supplements Good for the Heart?</span></a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/are-fish-or-fish-oil-supplements-good-for-the-heart/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-99478 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Fish oil capsules spilling out of a jar\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/b17-9-heart-is-fish-or-fish-oil-good-for-the-heart.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Five massive new trials have been published recently, randomizing tens of thousands to various formulations of fish oil versus placebo. Want to know my omega-3 recommendations? See my </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/optimum-nutrient-recommendations/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Optimum Nutrient Recommendations</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>#7 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-dietary-detox/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Best Dietary Detox</span></a></h4>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-dietary-detox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-100574 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Assortment of plant based foods from above in bowls\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/66-24-the-best-dietary-detox.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By eating at a lower rung on the food chain, those choosing plant-based diets aren’t as exposed to the industrial pollutants that bioaccumulate up the ladder.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>#6 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-lower-lpa-with-diet/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to Lower Lp(a) with Diet</span></a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-lower-lpa-with-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-63019 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"How to Lower Lp(a) with Diet\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What should we eat and what should we avoid to lower the cardiovascular disease risk factor lipoprotein(a)? </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>#5 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why Do Milk Drinkers Live Shorter Lives on Average?</span></a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-97280 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Milk being poured into a glass\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-18-why-do-milk-drinkers-live-shorter-lives-on-average-1.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How might we reduce the risk of premature death from dairy consumption? One way is to switch to soy milk. Check out</span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/is-soy-milk-the-most-nutritious-non-dairy-milk/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Is Soy Milk the Most Nutritious Non-Dairy Milk?</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>#4 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-boost-your-endothelial-progenitor-cells-epcs-for-heart-health/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to Boost Your Endothelial Progenitor Cells (EPCs) for Heart Health</span></a></h4>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-boost-your-endothelial-progenitor-cells-epcs-for-heart-health/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-97247 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Illustration of red blood cells\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/09/64-11-how-to-boost-your-epcs-endothelial-progenitor-cells.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a>How can we improve the capacity of our blood vessels to repair themselves? We can boost the ability of our endothelium to function by eating nitrate-rich vegetables, like beets and greens. See</span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/oxygenating-blood-with-nitrate-rich-vegetables/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Oxygenating Blood with Nitrate-Rich Vegetables</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>#3 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/webinar/preventing-and-treating-osteoporosis/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Preventing and Treating Osteoporosis (Webinar Recording)</span></a></h4>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/webinar/preventing-and-treating-osteoporosis/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-99266 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"image explains the webinar topic\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/10/osteoporosis-webinar-thumb.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In this two-hour webinar, I cover bone mineral density screening, common over-the-counter drugs like acid blockers that may increase fracture risk, how safe and effective the current oral and injected osteoporosis medications are, which foods may help protect our bones, the best type and frequency of exercise, and how to reduce fall risk.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>#2 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-age-live-presentation/\"><em>How Not to Age</em> – Live Presentation</a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-age-live-presentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-99314 size-medium\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail-960x540.jpg\" alt=\"Dr. Greger and the presentation title on a blue background\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/11/hnta-book-talk-thumbnail.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In this live lecture, I cover highlights from my book, </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-age/\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Not to Age</span></i></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, which became a </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">New York Times</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Best Seller</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. I hope it helps with your New Year’s resolutions. As always, all proceeds I receive from </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/books/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">all of my books</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> are donated directly to charity.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>#1 <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Can Alzheimer’s Disease Be Reversed with a Plant-Based Diet?</span></a></h4>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-108146 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"An assortment of colorful fruits, vegetables, and legumes on a flat surface\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2024/06/can-alzheimers-disease-be-reversed-with-a-plant-based-diet.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 356px) 100vw, 356px\"/></a>Dr. Dean Ornish published the first randomized controlled trial investigating whether a plant-based diet and lifestyle program may reverse the course of early-stage Alzheimer’s disease. What does improving the cognition and function of Alzheimer’s patients with lifestyle medicine actually translate into in terms of human impact? Check out </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/a-testimonial-from-dr-ornishs-alzheimers-progression-reversal-study/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A Testimonial from Dr. Ornish’s Alzheimer’s Progression Reversal Study</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thank you for being a part of this community. We gained </span><b>more than 140,000 new subscribers</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@NutritionFactsOrg\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in 2024, and the number of people we can reach with this life-saving, life-changing information continues to grow.</span></p>"
